-- recursive: overwrite
change c.txt, change c.txt
-- recursive: overwrite in a subdirectory
change sub/o.txt, change sub/o.txt
-- recursive: empty overwrite
change c.txt
-- recursive: append
change c.txt
-- file: overwrite
change f.txt
-- file: empty overwrite
change f.txt
-- file: append
change f.txt
-- file: overwrite, then append
change f.txt
-- directory: overwrite
change d.txt
-- two watchers on one file: overwrite
A change t.txt, B change t.txt
-- two watchers on one file: append
A change t.txt, B change t.txt
-- two watchers on one file: the second closed, then an append
A change t.txt
-- two watchers on one directory: a file created
A rename n.txt, B rename n.txt, A change n.txt, B change n.txt
-- a file and its directory: overwrite
dir change v.txt, file change v.txt, dir change v.txt, file change v.txt
-- a file and its directory: append
dir change v.txt, file change v.txt
done
